@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam packageBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam noteBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
title DC-O02 — UML object snapshots and frame condition
top to bottom direction
object "before : SourceContext" as source {
  selectedChange = available
}
object "before : ResumeDraft" as before {
 selectedField = oldValue
 independentOverride = retainedValue
}
object "after confirmed apply : ResumeDraft" as after {
 selectedField = selectedNewValue
 independentOverride = retainedValue
}
object "frame : LivePresentation" as live {
  content = unchangedByApply
}
object "frame : SubmittedMaterial" as sent {
  content = unchangedByApply
}
source ..> after : selected explicit apply
before ..> after : DC-O02 confirmed postcondition
after ..> live : no automatic publication
after ..> sent : no overwrite of actual history
note bottom of before
Precondition: exact intended draft, current authority/context,
selected changes and explicit confirmation.
Failure/unknown effects follow the operation contract;
this is only the confirmed-success snapshot.
end note

legend bottom
Symbolic analysis values, not stored records or proposed database fields. See DC-O02 and accepted profile policy.
endlegend
@enduml
